# Example: shared Time bound once, used as a $ component

## Schema

```
Game = $Time
Time = Int/t
```

## Construction

```
t = [:Time 0].
[:Game t]
```

## Methods

```
Time::update! = { [:Time t] }
Game::update! = { [:Game time] }
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var assemblage = GameAssemblage.factory();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    trace(assemblage.toConstruction(0, helper));
    assemblage.time.update_mutates();
    trace(assemblage.toConstruction(0, helper));
}
```
